From 50f8776ecadf453ed21be3cfd3b23a25ea85cfee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:28:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Collect every channel post except ads; report what was
 skipped

Posts with no text whose media was not a photo or document (polls, stories,
paid media, previews, unknown types) were dropped without a trace, so some
long research posts never reached the feed. The keep/skip rule now lives in
message_fields.py and is shared by the Actions collector and app.py:

- keep every post except advertisements; skip only service events
- label non-file media by kind (poll question/answers, preview title, ...)
- keep a post with nothing renderable as type "empty"
- download only photo/pdf/document for the Drive archive
- one bad message no longer aborts the rest of its channel
- health file gains skipped counts by reason and the ids of dropped posts
- attachment names are included in the secret check

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017sm19HmKNPSD4tGtrNokTD
